# Second ModelForge demonstration model: a small two-class sigmoid classifier.
model binary_sigmoid_classifier
input features float32 1,2
output probabilities float32 1,2

tensor weights float32 2,2 values=1.0,-1.0,-0.5,0.8
tensor bias float32 1,2 values=0.3,1.2

node dense Gemm features weights bias -> scores
node activation Sigmoid scores -> probabilities
